<title>JAPAN: Kansai Paint -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kansai Paint -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 79.87		vs	   77.19</p>
<p> Operating	    3.12		vs	    1.53</p>
<p> Current		3.09		vs	    1.83</p>
<p> Net		    1.58		vs	  920    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.66 yen	  vs	    3.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    279 million	  vs	 279 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kansai Paint Co Ltd is a major paint maker.</p>
